hsd|a|Adapted to cut; as, a cutting tool. ; Chilling; penetrating; sharp; as, a cutting wind. ; Severe; sarcastic; biting; as, a cutting reply.	j:njg,73,15;8ib,54,4;g3t,43,2;24h0,39,3;1899,35,4~njg,73,15;8ib,54,4;1899,35,4;24h0,39,3;g3t,43,2	e:167l,39,2~167l,39,2
